   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"10\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>A line segment of length <span data-math=\"l\">l</span> is scaled by a factor of 1.5 to produce a segment with length <span data-math=\"m\">m</span>. The new segment is then scaled by a factor of 1.5 to give a segment of length <span data-math=\"n\">n</span>.<br> <br> What scale factor takes the segment of length <span data-math=\"l\">l</span> to the segment of length <span data-math=\"n\">n</span>?&nbsp;<br></li>\n</ol>",
